    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presented in good condition, this attractive ground-floor apartment is located in the highly sought-after Brooklawn residential development on Castlerea Road, Ballaghaderreen, Co. Roscommon. \n\nIdeally positioned within walking distance of the town centre, the property enjoys easy access to a wide range of amenities including shops, restaurants, schools, churches, and sporting facilities.\n\nThe accommodation comprises of: \nBright and spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area featuring a combination of wood and tiled flooring, complemented by dual-aspect windows that provide an abundance of natural light. \nTwo well-proportioned bedrooms, \nOne of which benefits from patio doors opening onto the rear garden. \nA fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe property is connected to mains water and mains sewerage services.\n\nThis apartment offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors alike.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
